{"title":"Career Roadmap · Social Media Manager","role":"Social Media Manager","summary":"A BA in Journalism & Mass Communication provides a strong foundation for content creation, journalism, storytelling, media production, audience behaviour and communication. It is well aligned with Social Media Manager roles, but modern social media management requires more than content writing.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A competitive profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism","Content Strategy","Social Media","Digital Marketing","Analytics","Video","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The role can involve strategy, content planning, publishing, community management, campaign execution, influencer coordination, analytics, reputation management and brand communication."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build journalism, storytelling, social media, content and digital marketing foundations"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Enter Social Media Executive/Coordinator, Content Strategist, Community Manager or Digital Marketing roles"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Social Media Manager, Social Media Strategist, Content Lead or Digital Marketing Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Head of Social Media, Digital Marketing Head, Brand Communications Lead, Content Director or Social Strategy Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The ideal skill combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism","Storytelling","Social Media","Digital Marketing","Analytics","Visual Content"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Headline writing"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Media ethics"},{"text":"Digital journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Media Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content strategy"},{"text":"Platform strategy"},{"text":"Audience research"},{"text":"Community management"},{"text":"Social listening"},{"text":"Content calendars"},{"text":"Hashtag/keyword strategy"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Social analytics"},{"text":"Reputation management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Journalism & Communication Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic focus"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalism fundamentals"},{"text":"Mass communication"},{"text":"Media studies"},{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Communication theory"},{"text":"Digital media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Build"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Writing portfolio"},{"text":"Personal LinkedIn profile"},{"text":"Basic social media portfolio"},{"text":"Short-form content"},{"text":"News analysis"},{"text":"Interview content"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Platforms to understand"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"LinkedIn"},{"text":"Facebook"},{"text":"X"},{"text":"TikTok/short-form platforms where relevant"},{"text":"Emerging community platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not to become active on every platform, but to understand how audience behaviour and content formats differ across platforms."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Content Strategy & Digital Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from simply creating posts to understanding why content works."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"SEO fundamentals"},{"text":"Social media algorithms"},{"text":"Audience segmentation"},{"text":"Copywriting"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Video scripting"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Digital advertising fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Engagement rate"},{"text":"Video completion rate"},{"text":"Click-through rate"},{"text":"Follower growth"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Cost per click"},{"text":"Cost per acquisition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Build familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Adobe tools or equivalent"},{"text":"CapCut/Premiere or equivalent video tools"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Platform analytics dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Social Media Management"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on strategy, campaigns and measurable results."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social media strategy"},{"text":"Campaign planning"},{"text":"Brand voice"},{"text":"Content calendars"},{"text":"Community management"},{"text":"Crisis communication"},{"text":"Social listening"},{"text":"Paid social"},{"text":"Influencer campaigns"},{"text":"Performance reporting"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Build a complete campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"30-Day Brand Growth Campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audience research"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Brand positioning"},{"text":"Content pillars"},{"text":"Content calendar"},{"text":"20–30 content concepts"},{"text":"Short-form video concepts"},{"text":"Community strategy"},{"text":"Paid campaign plan"},{"text":"Analytics dashboard"},{"text":"Results"},{"text":"Recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social Media Strategy for a New Brand"},{"text":"Impact of Short-Form Video on Audience Engagement"},{"text":"Social Media and News Consumption Among Young Adults"},{"text":"Brand Storytelling on Instagram"},{"text":"Influencer Marketing Effectiveness"},{"text":"Social Media Crisis Management"},{"text":"Political/News Communication on Social Platforms"},{"text":"Social Media and Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Digital Journalism and Audience Engagement"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Social Media Content Strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Media Management Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional workflow is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Strategy","Content Planning","Creation","Publishing","Community Management","Monitoring","Analytics","Optimisation"]},{"type":"p","text":"A manager should be able to explain:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who is the audience, what are we communicating, why this content format, on which platform, what action do we want, and how will we measure success?"}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant internships include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social Media Intern"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Content Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Digital Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Social Media Management"},{"text":"Community Management"},{"text":"Brand Communications"},{"text":"Public Relations"},{"text":"Influencer Marketing"},{"text":"Content Creation"},{"text":"Video Content"},{"text":"SEO Content"},{"text":"News/Media Organisations"},{"text":"Advertising Agencies"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Agencies"},{"text":"Startups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internship"},{"type":"p","text":"A good internship should give exposure to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Content","Publishing","Analytics","Campaigns"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than only asking the student to make routine posts."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Role","Primary Skills"],"rows":[[{"te