response strategy for a hypothetical negative publicity event."}]},{"heading":"PG Study Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not mandatory for becoming a Social Media Manager."},{"type":"p","text":"However, useful options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Journalism & Mass Communication"},{"text":"MA Digital Media"},{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"MBA Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Master's in Advertising/Brand Communication"},{"text":"Master's in Public Relations"},{"text":"MSc Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Master's in Communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For career advancement, experience and measurable campaign results generally become more important than an additional general degree."},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Emerging Social Media Careers"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is rapidly changing social media management."},{"type":"h","text":"AI applications"},{"type":"h","text":"Content"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content ideation"},{"text":"Caption drafts"},{"text":"Script development"},{"text":"Content repurposing"},{"text":"Multilingual content"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Creative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Image generation"},{"text":"Video assistance"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Subtitling"},{"text":"Voice generation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audience analysis"},{"text":"Trend detection"},{"text":"Sentiment analysis"},{"text":"Performance summaries"},{"text":"Content recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content scheduling"},{"text":"Social listening"},{"text":"Customer support"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Workflow automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important human skills"},{"type":"p","text":"AI does not replace the need for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand judgment"},{"text":"Original storytelling"},{"text":"Editorial judgment"},{"text":"Crisis management"},{"text":"Community relationships"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"},{"text":"Cultural awareness"},{"text":"Ethical communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Social Media Strategy","AI","Analytics","Creative Judgment"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Key Social Media KPIs"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional manager should understand the difference between vanity metrics and business outcomes."},{"type":"h","text":"Awareness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Video views"},{"text":"Share of voice"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engagement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement rate"},{"text":"Shares"},{"text":"Saves"},{"text":"Comments"},{"text":"Watch time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Traffic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Link clicks"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Website sessions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Conversion"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"Purchases"},{"text":"Sign-ups"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Community"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Sentiment"},{"text":"Resolution rate"},{"text":"Returning users"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Fact-Checking","Writing","Editing","Storytelling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Social Media"},{"type":"flow","items":["Strategy","Content Planning","Publishing","Community Management","Social Listening"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Marketing","SEO","Paid Social","Influencer Marketing","CRO"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative"},{"type":"flow","items":["Copywriting","Graphic Design","Video Editing","Short-Form Video"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Platform Analytics","Excel","Power BI","Basic Statistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI Content Tools","Automation","Social Listening","AI-Assisted Analytics"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"BA Year 1"},{"text":"Journalism + content foundation"}],[{"text":"BA Year 2"},{"text":"Social media/content intern"}],[{"text":"BA Year 3"},{"text":"Social media/digital marketing intern + portfolio"}],[{"text":"After BA"},{"text":"Social Media Executive / Content Executive"}],[{"text":"2–4 years"},{"text":"Social Media Associate / Strategist"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Social Media Manager"}],[{"text":"7–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Social Media Manager / Social Strategy Lead"}],[{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Head of Social Media / Digital Marketing Lead"}],[{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Director / Content Director / Brand Communications Head"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For BA Journalism & Mass Communication → Social Media Manager, the degree provides the strongest advantage in storytelling, communication, research and media understanding. The student should then add the commercial and technical side of social media."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Journalism & Mass Communication","Social Media/Digital Marketing Internship","Social Media Executive","Social Media Strategist","Social Media Manager","Social Media Lead/Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future-ready profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism","Social Media Strategy","Digital Marketing","Short-Form Video","Analytics","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination allows the graduate to work not only in social media management but also across digital marketing, brand communications, content strategy, public relations, digital journalism, influencer marketing and social media analytics."}]}]}